{number: 13}
{title: All Hail The Power of Jesus' Name}
{key: G}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[G] All hail the power of [C] Jesus' [G] name!
Let [Em] angels [A7] prostrate [D] fall;
Bring [G] forth the royal [C] dia-[G] dem,
And [G] crown Him [D] Lord of [G] all;
Bring [C] forth the royal [G] diadem,
And [C] crown Him [G] Lord [D7] of [G] all!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
Ye [G] chosen seed of [C] Israel's [G] race,
Ye [Em] ransomed [A7] from the [D] fall,
Hail [G] Him Who saves you [C] by His [G] grace,
And [G] crown Him [D] Lord of [G] all;
Hail [C] Him Who saves you [G] by His grace,
And [C] crown Him [G] Lord [D7] of [G] all!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
Let [G] every kindred, [C] every [G] tribe,
On [Em] this ter-[A7] restrial [D] ball,
To [G] Him all majesty [C] as-[G] cribe,
And [G] crown Him [D] Lord of [G] all;
To [C] Him all majesty [G] ascribe,
And [C] crown Him [G] Lord [D7] of [G] all!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
O [G] that with yonder [C] sacred [G] throng
We [Em] at His [A7] feet may [D] fall!
We'll [G] join the ever-[C] lasting [G] song,
And [G] crown Him [D] Lord of [G] all;
We'll [C] join the ever-[G] lasting song,
And [C] crown Him [G] Lord [D7] of [G] all!
{end_of_verse}
